      <p class="/_attributes/common-attributes.md"></p>
      <p>To move a running virtual machine (VM) to a different node without interrupting the workload, you can initiate a live migration. You can also cancel an ongoing migration to keep the VM on its original node.</p>
      <p>You can initiate the live migration of a virtual machine (VM) to another node by using the OpenShift Container Platform web console or the command line.</p>
      <p>You can cancel a live migration by using the web console or the command line. The VM remains on its original node.</p>
